{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "55e3b2c2f7757fb9c2edd1d7cb5a9e7db1a7b9e300a833b3f8c63701dd6a4561", "ja": "公演のあとで…", "zh": "公演之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ed3e6d3c3ef7e2eeb548dbba82f79de23cc63403d3aa54e38931688b17e6722", "ja": "夢のような公演が終わり、余韻に浸る美咲、\n小鳥、社長。3人はアイドル達の成長が\nファンの笑顔に繋がったと確信。そして、\nプロデューサーの労をねぎらうと同時に、\nこの先のプロデュースに期待するのだった。", "zh": "如梦似幻的公演结束了，美咲、小鸟以及社长\n沉浸在余韵中。三人坚信偶像们的成长造就了\n粉丝脸上的笑容。他们慰劳制作人的辛苦，\n同时也对今后的培育寄予厚望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b441812960ffbab140729b7fad795188d7ba351267e3303cc6a29f02f1abb1c6", "ja": "（わあああああ……っ！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊啊啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8d8b654175ac657e7568897b5798351de6ce89fc4421e2d6874fc8b69c21499", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　{$P$}さん。\nとってもとっても、素敵なライブでしたね～！", "zh": "辛苦了！{$P$}先生。\n真是一场非常非常美好的演唱会呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "1d751dbfe3d0e3398569f49c1e89f79826c7909ac7df5775f96c6db40b746118", "ja": "私、最初から最後までず～っと応援しちゃいました！\nみんな、本当に素敵だったなぁ……♪", "zh": "我从开场一～直声援到结束！\n大家真的都好棒……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "f840314bb07cd8bc2b4da70f4300b052c374e156ca63a4e6a110e7a59b9d25a5", "ja": "ふふっ。すごかったんですよ、美咲ちゃん。\n途中で感極まって泣いちゃったんです。", "zh": "呵呵，美咲她很夸张喔，\n中途还感动到哭了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9ffb7b18fcd26f7c89ec9636f0189d50fe8876bd8f478db9336b4deabd4090f", "ja": "あー！　{$P$}さんには秘密にって、\nいったのに……音無先輩～！", "zh": "啊──！你明明答应我要瞒着\n{$P$}先生的……音无前辈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "deb4ca0cdc337fa30065be221d4ebbe14d5d1543ff11ea7858510909a83af207", "ja": "大丈夫♪　私もだけど、{$P$}さんも\nきっと、美咲ちゃんと同じ気持ちだったから。ふふっ！", "zh": "放心♪不只是我，{$P$}先生\n肯定也和美咲有同样的心情，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1006_president", "source_sha256": "837dc44098af553f6a8a05843a6841d914db15030a433a449144f74fbfc60cef", "ja": "うむ。アイドル諸君は、\n我々の想像以上の成長ぶりを見せてくれた。", "zh": "嗯，诸位偶像的成长相当亮眼，\n超越了我们的想像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1007_president", "source_sha256": "45e43152662bffb86f2681a5fe59fd533a3ebbdde3cdef5a3a1cfc3d1d8973b5", "ja": "その結果が、この歓声、この感動、そして……\n皆の笑顔に繋がったのだと、私は確信しているよ！", "zh": "我坚信是成果造就了这些欢呼声、这份感动，\n以及……众人脸上的笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "09201abd956166a44537ee7d436ea290bf2afba459eaa7f85ee610c457bec5e7", "ja": "それも{$P$}さんが、ずっとアイドル\nのみんなと一緒に、歩いて来てくれたからです。", "zh": "这也要归功于{$P$}先生\n一直陪伴着偶像们走到今天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1009_president", "source_sha256": "b1377dad86093ed94caa011d8501bc440e42a72f517c1e583576af586f6c60b9", "ja": "君、本当に、よくここまで彼女達を導いてくれた。\nやはり君を選んだ私の目に狂いはなかった！", "zh": "真的辛苦你引领她们走到这一步了。\n当初选上你，我果然没有看走眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1010_president", "source_sha256": "70c34c61b90ad0d084592a8372a16afb9c72372fc646efb400977e90c4d54317", "ja": "ファンの皆も、今日のステージを見て、\n彼女達のこれからに大きな期待を抱いたことだろう。", "zh": "粉丝们看了今天的表演，\n想必也会对她们未来的发展寄予厚望吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1011_president", "source_sha256": "024f4a1e48a62fb445af3c1ffe1d10d43949ae9821b1243943cc0d3c75cd0c24", "ja": "引き続き、アイドル諸君が正しい道を進めるよう\nプロデュースしてやってくれたまえ。よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "你要继续培育偶像们，\n引领她们走在正确的道路上，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "46d6df373081c5bb98584d85479599a34789e601fa9bfb885ef0bb91b7063354", "ja": "私達も、{$P$}さんをしっかり\nサポートできるように、頑張りますね！", "zh": "我们也会加油，为{$P$}先生\n提供更完善的支援！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1013_president", "source_sha256": "165dee34a01a037c9617f6043c9d19abfb4c1141e3a5d84f1fd4f1bb1392ac77", "ja": "うぉっほん！　では、ここで新たな門出を祝って……\n新作手品をお披露目しようじゃないか！", "zh": "咳咳！那么，为了庆祝全新的出发……\n就让我来表演新魔术吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "9ecb6510389dc78098d976b319140abce465cec8d2e3c49eec8ce7a5468ae000", "ja": "あ、社長、みんなの帰り支度が終わったみたいです。\nそろそろ行きましょうね！", "zh": "啊，社长，大家好像准备好要回去了。\n我们差不多该走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1015_president", "source_sha256": "1ca17a2d51c9104f564f9d818654d29bddf3d759f52bcaf30992ac3b68be5612", "ja": "そ、そうかね……。仕方ない。\n手品はまたの機会にすることにしよう。", "zh": "这、这样啊……没办法，\n魔术就等下次有机会再表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "f5fcec43d657e407ce6843d37b167fef10ddae56be8fcc31c9072d819fb76e75", "ja": "急いでくださいね～、みんなが待ってますから。\nそれじゃ……。", "zh": "请快一点～大家都在等喔。\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_14_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "5100bcb044cc0b8ceb155bea2c15eff4ab30d6095341044e214d0ca28ac43ab0", "ja": "いつものように、みんなで一緒に帰りましょう。\n私達の、765プロライブ劇場に！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "就像平常一样，大家一起回去吧～\n回到我们的765艺能演唱会剧场！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
